      "text": "衰病死诗诀",
      "layer": "historical_work_transcription",
      "passage_id": "yuanhai:c274:p0002",
      "sha256": "beadedfaf04e81dd6d0c31d51f1385d91ef57daa0bcfb95edd842335f3732387"
    },
    {
      "section": "衰病死诗诀",
      "text": "纳音衰病死重逢，成败之中见吉凶，若得吉神来救助，变灾为福始亨通。",
      "layer": "historical_work_transcription",
      "passage_id": "yuanhai:c274:p0003",
      "sha256": "e6988961eda1b077f669886af14051c2796d1c8ad013702ca29cef810962096b"
    },
    {
      "section": "衰病死诗诀",
      "text": "衰病两逢兼值死，世人至老无妻子，不惟衣食不丰隆，灾病绵绵终损己。",
      "layer": "historical_work_transcription",
      "passage_id": "yuanhai:c274:p0004",
      "sha256": "53a2a8ae75718278406ad80ed65c97550e2a844301a2fe2b55dbee9630df2f71"
    },
    {
      "section": "衰病死诗诀",
      "text": "眉批：五行以此比人之至六七十，由老衰弱而又死命中遇此，主人孤苦之断。",
      "layer": "historical_commentary",
      "commentary_spans": [
        {
